{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HOS","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"何西阿书","commonName":"何西阿书","title":"何西阿书","order":28,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"04647d3e8f44e649b6d73328cb40599132a398e7b6297ea6c2f76790eabfc589","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HOS/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":196},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["何西阿和那不贞的妇人"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华对我说：「你再去爱一个淫妇，就是她情人所爱的；好像以色列人，虽然偏向别神，喜爱葡萄饼，耶和华还是爱他们。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["我便用银子十五舍客勒，大麦一贺梅珥半，买她归我。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我对她说：「你当多日为我独居，不可行淫，不可归别人为妻，我向你也必这样。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["以色列人也必多日独居，无君王，无首领，无祭祀，无柱像，无以弗得，无家中的神像。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["后来以色列人必归回",{"noteId":10},"，寻求他们的 神—耶和华和他们的王大卫。在末后的日子，必以敬畏的心归向耶和华，领受他的恩惠。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":10,"caller":"-","text":"或译：回心转意","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":5}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HOS/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HOS/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HOS/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}